---
import { Cpu, Shield, Layers, Wrench, CheckCircle2 } from 'lucide-react';
---

<section class="section-spacing" style="background: #FFFFFF; border-bottom: 1px solid #E2E8F0;">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="badge-arch">Metallurgical Rigour</span>
      <h2>Engineered For Extreme Durability</h2>
      <p>
        Every millimeter of our invisible grill system is engineered from marine and aerospace alloys to deliver unyielding fall resistance without degrading over time.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr)); gap: 2rem; align-items: center;">
      <!-- Visual Engineering Breakdown Card -->
      <div style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #E2E8F0; border-radius: 20px; padding: 2rem; position: relative; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);">
        <div style="position: absolute; top: 0; right: 0; padding: 0.5rem 1rem; background: #E0F2FE; border-bottom-left-radius: 14px; font-size: 0.75rem; color: #0284C7; font-weight: 700;">
          ANATOMY OF SS316 CABLE
        </div>

        <h3 style="font-size: 1.35rem; font-weight: 800; color: #0F172A; margin-bottom: 1.25rem;">
          Cross-Section Multi-Strand Cable
        </h3>

        <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.25rem;">
          <div style="display: flex; gap: 1rem; align-items: flex-start;">
            <div style="width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 50%; background: #0284C7; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.85rem; flex-shrink: 0;">1</div>
            <div>
              <h4 style="font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700; color: #0F172A; margin-bottom: 0.2rem;">DuPont Pure Nylon Encapsulation</h4>
              <p style="font-size: 0.88rem; color: #475569; line-height: 1.5;">
                High-grade transparent membrane prevents hand friction, repels moisture and airborne salt, and filters UV light to prevent steel thermal expansion.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div style="display: flex; gap: 1rem; align-items: flex-start;">
            <div style="width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 50%; background: #0284C7; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.85rem; flex-shrink: 0;">2</div>
            <div>
              <h4 style="font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700; color: #0F172A; margin-bottom: 0.2rem;">7×7 High-Tensile Wire Core</h4>
              <p style="font-size: 0.88rem; color: #475569; line-height: 1.5;">
                49 micro-strands of virgin 316 marine-grade steel tightly wound to achieve 400+ kgf tensile capacity while preserving smooth flexibility.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div style="display: flex; gap: 1rem; align-items: flex-start;">
            <div style="width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 50%; background: #0284C7; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.85rem; flex-shrink: 0;">3</div>
            <div>
              <h4 style="font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700; color: #0F172A; margin-bottom: 0.2rem;">6063-T6 Aerospace Track System</h4>
              <p style="font-size: 0.88rem; color: #475569; line-height: 1.5;">
                Extruded architectural aluminium profiles treated with 25-micron hard anodization to anchor securely into solid concrete without twisting.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Engineering Specifications Grid -->
      <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1.25rem;">
        <div class="arch-card" style="padding: 1.5rem;">
          <div style="font-size: 0.75rem; color: #0284C7; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 0.3rem;">STEEL GRADE</div>
          <div style="font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: 800; color: #0F172A; margin-bottom: 0.4rem;">AISI 316 Marine</div>
          <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: #475569; line-height: 1.5;">
            Contains 2.5% Molybdenum specifically formulated to resist chloride attack and pitting.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="arch-card" style="padding: 1.5rem;">
          <div style="font-size: 0.75rem; color: #0284C7; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 0.3rem;">TENSILE TOLERANCE</div>
          <div style="font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: 800; color: #0F172A; margin-bottom: 0.4rem;">400+ kg Breaking Load</div>
          <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: #475569; line-height: 1.5;">
            Certified to withstand massive kinetic impact forces without cable deformation.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="arch-card" style="padding: 1.5rem;">
          <div style="font-size: 0.75rem; color: #0284C7; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 0.3rem;">ANCHORING SYSTEM</div>
          <div style="font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: 800; color: #0F172A; margin-bottom: 0.4rem;">M8/M10 Concrete Anchors</div>
          <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: #475569; line-height: 1.5;">
            Heavy-duty expansion studs seated deep into slab concrete for permanent stability.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="arch-card" style="padding: 1.5rem;">
          <div style="font-size: 0.75rem; color: #0284C7; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 0.3rem;">OPTICAL CLARITY</div>
          <div style="font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: 800; color: #0F172A; margin-bottom: 0.4rem;">98% Open Vista</div>
          <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: #475569; line-height: 1.5;">
            Allows complete daylight immersion and unhindered skyline vistas from all room angles.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
